message: "If you use this software or game, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Arquivivo"
abstract: >-
  Arquivivo is an educational game where players become guardians of collective memory. 
  The mission is to preserve and protect documents and archives against weather hazards, 
  disasters, and state violence. Every decision shapes the reconstruction of community 
  history and the defense of their voices.
